    42	
    43	`rand()` is `srand(time(0))` by default, or `srand(SEED)` with `--random-seed SEED` (`main.c:488-495`). Range is machine primes in `(2^30, 1303905301]`. `generate_lucky_primes` runs first and is then overwritten at `p[0]`.
