    45	The `-g` path (`print_msolve_gbtrace_qq` → `groebner_qq` → `core_groebner_qq`) does **not** call `remove_content_of_initial_basis` (that is the `msolve.c` parametrization path). Content of a generator is excluded only if it is one of the stored coefficients.
