+Its provenance, archive, source tarball, hashes, and controls are preserved
+under
+`box/moh14-charts-20260905/tools/msolve-0.10.1-official-intel-avx512/`.
+On a matched ten-minute `M2_9 V3_8` 32-row-prefix run at \(p=32003\), both
