+
+### 6.2 Full-fibre msolve endpoints
+
+Every row below means the complete source generator list plus `z*c-1`.
+Prefixes and selected-row probes are excluded from the fibre verdict.  An
+empty `.g2.out` is reported as `TIMEOUT`, never as `NONUNIT`.
+
