+An exact rational hand reduction of the top `Mm15` block forced several top
+`A/B` coefficients to zero and descended one level, but the target row still
+had 1,761 terms including `-c`; `Mm12` retained 6,669 terms including `-c`.
+This is partial structure, not a contradiction.  No subset result is promoted
+to survival.
+
+### 6.4 Class verdict
+
+| residual class | fibres proved UNIT | class result | reason |
+|---|---:|---|---|
+| `M6_13` | 0 / 3 | `TIMEOUT` | two full generators missing; third solve unfinished |
+| `M2_9` | 0 / 2 | `TIMEOUT` | both generated; neither solve finished |
