+`0436525b06fe83b1a6a00097a96d9bcafdc40d8de6315c724b9ada9a4c04ff5f`;
+its upstream-install provenance file is
+`ad3c11ee1c122ad5f4c4bdb5437877a098f70afb903c4d26d2635202791b67e7`.
+The deployed 0.6.5 binary hash is in section 3.
+
+Remote jobs were launched with `setsid`/`nohup`.  At the final cutoff every
+lane-owned residual process was stopped and checked absent; an unfinished
+process is never silently described as a completed basis.  The canonical
+post-body integrity seal below is appended only after the report is final.
